<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net"><diagram name="D0 Block diagram" id="d0"><mxGraphModel dx="1000" dy="700" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="765" pageHeight="540" math="0" shadow="0"><root><mxCell id="0"/><mxCell id="1" parent="0"/><mxCell id="n1" value='&lt;font style="font-size:11px" color="#1F3B5C"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Financial Literacy &amp;amp; Stock Learning Platform — D0 Block diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="4.0" width="733.0" height="14.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n2" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.5px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Goal: Help early earners (ages 18–30) build financial literacy — budgeting, saving and the main forms of investing — so they can plan a better financial future with their own numbers and real market data before risking&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.5px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;real money.&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="19.0" width="733.0" height="22.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="learner" value='&lt;font style="font-size:8px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Learner (person)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=30;fillColor=#E1F2DF;strokeColor=#3C7A3A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="52.0" width="110.0" height="26.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c1" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Web Client&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;browser interface&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="102.0" width="110.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e1" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;E1&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Identity Provider&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;OpenID Connect, vendor-run&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=10;fillColor=#FDEBD3;strokeColor=#C46A00;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="525.0" y="102.0" width="110.0" height="40.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c2" value='&lt;font style="font-size:8.5px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C2 · API Gateway — single entry point to the backend&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=14;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="170.0" width="622.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n3" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.5px" color="#1F3B5C"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Basic input&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.2px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;The learner’s own numbers (income, expenses, debts, monthly savings, years), stock tickers to research, plus&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.2px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;market quotes from E2.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.5px" color="#1F3B5C"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Basic output&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.2px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;A budget summary with emergency-fund goal, a comparison of how savings could grow in different forms of&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.2px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;investing, lessons with plain-language explanations, and stock snapshots with red flags.&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9AA7B5;strokeWidth=0.8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140.0" y="52.0" width="372.0" height="90.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="grp" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#2F5D8A"&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;Backend services&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=5;fillColor=#F4F8FC;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=0.8;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140.0" y="222.0" width="418.0" height="98.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e3" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;E3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;AI Language Model API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;vendor-run&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FDEBD3;strokeColor=#C46A00;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="244.0" width="110.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c3" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C3&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Learning Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;lessons, tooltips, guides&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="150.0" y="244.0" width="110.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c4" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C4&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Planning Engine&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;budget, growth what-ifs&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="294.0" y="244.0" width="110.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c5" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C5&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stock Research Service&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;snapshots, red flags, picks&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="438.0" y="244.0" width="110.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="e2" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.8px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;b&gt;E2&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:8.6px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Stock Data API&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:6.3px" color="#444444"&gt;&lt;i&gt;vendor-run&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=6;fillColor=#FDEBD3;strokeColor=#C46A00;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="582.0" y="244.0" width="110.0" height="62.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c6" value='&lt;font style="font-size:8px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;C6 · App Database — progress, plans, practice picks, cached market data&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#E6E6EC;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="140.0" y="360.0" width="418.0" height="26.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n4" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=0.8;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="140.0" y="364.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="558.0" y="364.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n5" value="I1" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="learner" target="c1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n6" value="I2" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c1" target="c2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n7" value="I3" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.9;exitY=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="e1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n8" value="I4" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.319935691318328;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n9" value="I5" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.5514469453376206;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n10" value="I6" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.7829581993569131;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c2" target="c5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n11" value="I7" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0;exitY=0.5;entryX=1;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c3" target="e3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n12" value="I8" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=1;exitY=0.5;entryX=0;entryY=0.5;" edge="1" parent="1" source="c5" target="e2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n13" value="I9" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;" edge="1" parent="1" source="grp" target="c6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n14" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=4;fillColor=#FAFAFA;strokeColor=#9AA7B5;strokeWidth=0.8;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="6.0" y="404.0" width="733.0" height="108.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n15" value='&lt;font style="font-size:8px" color="#1F3B5C"&gt;&lt;b&gt;Legend — conventions used on this diagram&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="14.0" y="409.0" width="300.0" height="11.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n16" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#DCE9F7;strokeColor=#2F5D8A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="426.0" width="30.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n17" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Rounded blue box = a component the team builds (C1–C6)&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54.0" y="428.0" width="330.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n18" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=20;fillColor=#FDEBD3;strokeColor=#C46A00;strokeWidth=1.4;dashed=1;dashPattern=4 3;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="447.0" width="30.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n19" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Dashed orange box = external system we depend on but do not build (E1–E3)&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54.0" y="449.0" width="330.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n20" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=46;fillColor=#E1F2DF;strokeColor=#3C7A3A;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="468.0" width="30.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n21" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Green box = a person using the system&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54.0" y="470.0" width="330.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n22" value="" style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=#E6E6EC;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.2;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16.0" y="489.0" width="30.0" height="15.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n23" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=none;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=0.8;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="16.0" y="493.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="46.0" y="493.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n24" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Grey box with top band = data store&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="54.0" y="491.0" width="330.0" height="12.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n25" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=none;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="396.0" y="433.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="436.0" y="433.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n26" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Line with arrowhead = an interface. The arrow points from the caller to the callee; the&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;reply returns over the same connection.&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="444.0" y="426.0" width="290.0" height="24.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n27" value="" style="html=1;rounded=0;endArrow=block;endFill=1;startArrow=block;startFill=1;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=1;labelBackgroundColor=#FFFFFF;fontSize=8;fontStyle=1;" edge="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry"><mxPoint x="396.0" y="462.0" as="sourcePoint"/><mxPoint x="436.0" y="462.0" as="targetPoint"/></mxGeometry></mxCell><mxCell id="n28" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Two-way arrow = the learner types or clicks in (input) and sees results (output).&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="444.0" y="456.0" width="290.0" height="24.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n29" value='&lt;font style="font-size:6.5px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;&lt;b&gt;I#&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=1;arcSize=40;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#333333;strokeWidth=0.7;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="406.0" y="484.0" width="20.0" height="10.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="n30" value='&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;Pill label (I1…I9) = interface ID, matching one row of the Interface specification table and&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style="font-size:7.3px" color="#1A1A1A"&gt;the arrow labels in the data-flow diagrams.&lt;/font&gt;' style="html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;spacing=1;rounded=0;fillColor=none;strokeColor=none;strokeWidth=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="444.0" y="482.0" width="290.0" height="28.0" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>